== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Helmet
|rarity = uncommon
|farming_fortune = 10
|item_ability_name = Sparkle
|item_ability_activation = Right Click
|item_ability_description = Spread happiness to someone one {{Red|s}}{{Orange|p}}{{Yellow|a}}{{Green|r}}{{Aqua|k}}{{Pink|l}}{{Red|e}} at a time!
|item_ability_cooldown = 5s
}}
Clicking on other players while wearing a '''Sunflower Head''' allows the player to spread happiness at the cost of {{Stat|hp}}, with the cost starting at {{Red|0%}} and increasing by {{Red|5%}} after every use. The ability cannot be used if the player does not have enough {{Stat|Health}}.

After {{Green|20}} uses, (when it should be {{Red|100%}}) the cost becomes {{Red|Your Soul}}. Despite this, using the ability still requires the player to be at {{Stat|Health|100%}}. Once this occurs, using the ability displays a dialogue asking whether the player is certain that they want to use the ability. Upon confirming a few times, the player is killed, which displays a special death message and consumes the '''Sunflower Head'''.

