== Trivia ==
* Dying to a '''Sunflower Head''' for the first time grants the player the {{ach|Too much joy|ach=True}}.
* The {{Item|Phoenix Pet}}'s {{AN|Rekindle}} ability saves you from dying to the '''Sunflower Head'''.

